  bodyFont: {fileID: 0}
  libraryEntries:
  - name: 'Chapter 1: The Fall'
    category: 3
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    backstory: 'Long ago, the floating islands drifted peacefully above a sea of
      mountains.


      Then one stormy night, the great crystal that held them
      in the sky cracked. Platforms began to wander, strange creatures appeared,
      and the people of the islands fled.


      (Replace this with your class''s
      story!)'
  - name: 'Chapter 2: The Hero Wakes'
    category: 3
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    backstory: 'When the storm cleared, one person was left behind: the Hero. With
      no memory of who they were, they set off to find the pieces of the crystal
      and put the sky back together.


      Every level is one step closer to the
      truth...'
  - name: The Hero
    category: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    backstory: 'Nobody knows where the Hero came from. One morning they simply woke
      up at the edge of the map with a strange urge to jump on things.


      They
      can sprint (hold Left Shift) until they run out of breath, and they''ve learned
      the hard way that falling from very high up hurts.


      (Replace this with
      your own backstory!)'
  - name: Platform Patroller
    category: 1
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    backstory: 'Patrollers walk the same path back and forth, day after day. They
      were once the guards of a floating castle, and they still haven''t been told
      it fell down years ago.


      Touching one hurts, so time your jumps carefully.'
  - name: Wanderer
    category: 1
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    backstory: 'Wanderers have no idea where they''re going and they don''t care.
      They drift around their home area looking for something they lost a long time
      ago.


      They bump into anyone who gets in the way.'
  - name: Health Booster
    category: 2
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    backstory: A glowing snack left behind by a kind traveller. Grab one to get some
      health back.
  - name: Stamina Booster
    category: 2
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    backstory: Smells like energy drink and bad decisions. Refills your stamina so
      you can keep sprinting.
  - name: Jump & Sprint Buffs
    category: 2
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    backstory: Ancient charms that make your legs feel like springs for a short time.
      Jump buffs make you jump higher. Sprint buffs make you run faster.
  - name: Invincibility Charm
    category: 2
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    backstory: While this charm's magic lasts, nothing can hurt you. Use the time
      wisely!
  - name: Bouncy Obstacle
    category: 2
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    backstory: Some rocks here are strangely rubbery. Run into one and you'll be
      launched into the air. Great for reaching high places, terrible for your dignity.
  - name: Oldman-model
    category: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 929435404c3a80f498ab366c459b6254, type: 3}
    backstory: 'Who is Oldman-model? Where did they come from, and why are they here?


      Write
      the backstory here!'
  - name: Spider-model
    category: 1
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9fcb3c545714d104092657058109c8b6, type: 3}
    backstory: 'Who is Spider-model? Where did they come from, and why are they here?


      Write
      the backstory here!'
